&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Tracer] support OTel thread context propagation on Linux (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5269790890" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/9147" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9147/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9147"&gt;#9147&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Tracer] Add Azure Durable Functions tracing (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5396979940" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/9217" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9217/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9217"&gt;#9217&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix cross-language DSM pathway extraction for AWS messages (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5545112599" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/9289" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9289/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9289"&gt;#9289&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Changes&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Tracer&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;fix(openfeature): accept empty string as valid targeting key (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4155200069" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/8384" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8384/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8384"&gt;#8384&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Tracer] support OTel thread context propagation on Linux (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5269790890" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/9147" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9147/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9147"&gt;#9147&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Tracer] Add Azure Durable Functions tracing (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5396979940" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/9217" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9217/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9217"&gt;#9217&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Copy ASP.NET Core activity tags we haven't set, instead of filtering them (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5553603291" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/9297" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9297/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9297"&gt;#9297&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Initial runtime-async support for .NET 11 (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5567446283" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/9305" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9305/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9305"&gt;#9305&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix various minor issues identified in .NET 11 update (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5528916971" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/9280" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9280/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9280"&gt;#9280&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enforce ot tracestate value limit (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5616430486" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/9324" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9324/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9324"&gt;#9324&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;feat(otel): Emit OpenTelemetry HTTP semantic conventions on HTTP server spans (ASP.NET) (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5125524704" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/9027" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9027/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9027"&gt;#9027&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;feat(otel): Support the required startup hook for opentelemetry-operator installation (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5576357334" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/9314" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9314/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9314"&gt;#9314&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Docs] Keep customer data out of pull requests (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5677316232" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/9356" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9356/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9356"&gt;#9356&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
